{"id":"448fd9b6739a76f4","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-order2-coinitial-subset.md","title":"ZFC Order2 Coinitial Subset","display":"df-zfc-order2-coinitial-subset — ZFC Order2 Coinitial Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order2-coinitial-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order2-coinitial-subset","58-df-zfc-order6-coinitial-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-order2-coinitial-subset — ZFC Order2 Coinitial Subset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order2-coinitial-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order2-coinitial-subset</span><span>58-df-zfc-order6-coinitial-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order2-coinitial-subset — ZFC Order2 Coinitial Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (poset carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq P\">\\(C\\subseteq P\\)</span> (coinitial subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P\\)</span> (poset order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CoinitialSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CoinitialSubset}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (merged carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (merged order relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CoinitialSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CoinitialSubset}_S\\)</span> (merged predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}coinitial\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CoinitialSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}coinitial\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CoinitialSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}coinitial\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CoinitialSubset}_S(C,X,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land C\\subseteq X\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,x\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}coinitial\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CoinitialSubset}_S(C,X,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land C\\subseteq X\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,x\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The order6 coinitial-subset variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P$ (poset carrier, see [[58-df-zfc-partial-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-partial-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CoinitialSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CoinitialSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}coinitial\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2CoinitialSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}coinitial\\text{-}subset} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CoinitialSubset}_S(C,X,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\land C\\subseteq X\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,x\\rangle\\in R)","display":true}],"bytes":1418,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2927","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-order2-coinitial-subset.md|58-df-zfc-order2-coinitial-subset]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5"]}